# Lite Phase-1 triage model for low-RAM hosts (e.g. a 16 GB VM).
#
# Dolphin 3.0 (Llama 3.1 8B) from the Ollama library — ~5 GB, runs comfortably
# in 16 GB RAM. This is NOT the paper's exact model (Dolphin 3.0 R1 Mistral 24B);
# Phase 1 is non-deterministic triage, so the lighter model is fine for the
# scaled-down E1 demonstration. Registered under the same name the pipeline
# expects so `--model dolphin3-r1` keeps working.
#
# Used by:  ./setup.sh --lite   (or setup_alt.sh)
#   ollama create dolphin3-r1 -f Modelfile.8b
#
# For the faithful 24B model, use the default Modelfile instead.

FROM dolphin3
